            "block_content": "Have two (2) years continuous Regular (twenty (20) hours or more per week) recent experience as a Registered Ultrasound Technologist in two (2) or more modalities and must, to the satisfaction of the department manager be fully proficient in performing all the duties of an Ultrasound Technologist; or,",
